[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       cold JIT compile       -> tt_metal/tools/kernel_prewarm/prewarm_and_submit.sh
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       profiler post-process  -> capture with 'tracy -p' only; process_ops_logs.py on the host
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       CPU reference / PCC    -> run the oracle off-reservation
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]   (b) CHUNK IT — each chunk lands under the limit, and ALL the work still runs:
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       monolithic pipeline    -> one capture per stage/block, stitch off-device
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       long sweep             -> several shorter jobs
[ttw 2026-10-14T03:43:49-0700]       untraced/eager gen     -> the traced/warm path
